2026-07-27T12:59:04.6774339Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:59:04.6775254Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
